  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "你知道 AI 智能体记得越多，为什么反而可能越笨吗？",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 4.128,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.168,
      "spokenEnd": 3.469,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft Research 指出，长交互历史会把有用经验和无关细节混在一起。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.256,
      "audioStart": 3.473,
      "spokenStart": 3.629,
      "spokenEnd": 8.087,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "智能体每次都从更大的材料堆里找答案，上下文被噪声占满，真正会改变下一步的约束反而更难被找到。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.512,
      "audioStart": 8.081,
      "spokenStart": 8.247,
      "spokenEnd": 14.961,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这一期给你一张 AI 智能体保留、提炼、遗忘表：判断什么该继续可用，什么要压缩成经验，什么不该再抢占注意力。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.64,
      "audioStart": 14.959,
      "spokenStart": 15.121,
      "spokenEnd": 22.953,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "目标不是让智能体拥有完美记忆，而是拥有能支持当前决策的最小有效记忆；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.64,
      "audioStart": 22.95,
      "spokenStart": 23.113,
      "spokenEnd": 27.943,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "每次检索都要配得上当前任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 27.877,
      "spokenStart": 28.043,
      "spokenEnd": 29.978,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 29.981,
      "spokenStart": 30.138,
      "spokenEnd": 35.911,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 2 章：原始历史。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.16,
      "audioStart": 35.937,
      "spokenStart": 36.091,
      "spokenEnd": 37.468,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "先分清完整日志和有用记忆不是同一件事。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.744,
      "audioStart": 37.407,
      "spokenStart": 37.568,
      "spokenEnd": 40.525,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "一次交互记录里，可能同时有决策、失败搜索、复制材料、过期计划和临时工具报错。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 40.521,
      "spokenStart": 40.685,
      "spokenEnd": 46.33,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "保留原记录，对追溯和恢复很重要；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.976,
      "audioStart": 46.324,
      "spokenStart": 46.49,
      "spokenEnd": 48.658,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "但把整段记录送回每一个新任务，是另一种完全不同的选择。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.632,
      "audioStart": 48.592,
      "spokenStart": 48.758,
      "spokenEnd": 52.583,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "检索到的无关细节越多，智能体越难找到真正会改变当前判断的条件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.328,
      "audioStart": 52.591,
      "spokenStart": 52.743,
      "spokenEnd": 57.286,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "所以更多记忆可能看似提高了回忆量，却让推理更慢、更不可靠。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.16,
      "audioStart": 57.294,
      "spokenStart": 57.446,
      "spokenEnd": 61.826,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "更危险的是，智能体会把一条过期细节和一条关键约束放在同一层级，无法主动判断谁该优先进入当前窗口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 8.544,
      "audioStart": 61.765,
      "spokenStart": 61.926,
      "spokenEnd": 69.666,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把历史当成需要加工的来源，而不是必须整桶倒进上下文的材料。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 69.66,
      "spokenStart": 69.826,
      "spokenEnd": 73.867,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.464,
      "audioStart": 73.873,
      "spokenStart": 74.027,
      "spokenEnd": 74.698,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，原始历史用于追溯，不等于默认提示词。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 74.643,
      "spokenStart": 74.798,
      "spokenEnd": 77.863,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，先区分保存事件和当前检索事件的价值。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.104,
      "audioStart": 77.868,
      "spokenStart": 78.023,
      "spokenEnd": 81.333,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用是否改善下一步决策来衡量记忆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.696,
      "audioStart": 81.333,
      "spokenStart": 81.493,
      "spokenEnd": 84.398,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 3 章：有用单元。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.112,
      "audioStart": 84.426,
      "spokenStart": 84.578,
      "spokenEnd": 85.919,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "把经验转成 AI 智能体真正能复用的东西。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.384,
      "audioStart": 85.853,
      "spokenStart": 86.019,
      "spokenEnd": 88.597,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原文描述了一种转变：不只保存文本片段，而是保存结构化知识。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.04,
      "audioStart": 88.594,
      "spokenStart": 88.757,
      "spokenEnd": 92.99,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "一类单元是事实，例如已经核实的约束、当前设置，或能缩小安全操作范围的结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.216,
      "audioStart": 92.99,
      "spokenStart": 93.15,
      "spokenEnd": 98.585,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "另一类单元是可复用技能：什么时候行动、要收集什么证据、何时停止的紧凑步骤。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.144,
      "audioStart": 98.58,
      "spokenStart": 98.745,
      "spokenEnd": 104.079,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "事实回答当前任务里什么足够可信；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.192,
      "audioStart": 104.083,
      "spokenStart": 104.239,
      "spokenEnd": 106.635,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "技能回答下次遇到同类模式时怎样推进。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 106.583,
      "spokenStart": 106.735,
      "spokenEnd": 109.47,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u03",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "两者都应带着来源或触发条件，避免把一次碰巧成功的做法误写成任何环境都适用的规则。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 109.404,
      "spokenStart": 109.57,
      "spokenEnd": 115.332,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这样可以去掉重复叙述，却不丢失交互中真正有价值的经验。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 115.327,
      "spokenStart": 115.492,
      "spokenEnd": 119.261,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.464,
      "audioStart": 119.267,
      "spokenStart": 119.421,
      "spokenEnd": 120.092,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，把已核实事实从原始记录中提取出来。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.768,
      "audioStart": 120.038,
      "spokenStart": 120.192,
      "spokenEnd": 123.169,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，把可重复的过程写成技能，而不是保存故事。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.96,
      "audioStart": 123.171,
      "spokenStart": 123.329,
      "spokenEnd": 126.489,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，让每个单元只服务一个未来判断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 126.492,
      "spokenStart": 126.649,
      "spokenEnd": 129.141,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 4 章：任务路由。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.016,
      "audioStart": 129.162,
      "spokenStart": 129.321,
      "spokenEnd": 130.537,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "只检索属于当前任务的知识。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.52,
      "audioStart": 130.477,
      "spokenStart": 130.637,
      "spokenEnd": 132.355,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "PlugMem 用高层概念和推断出的意图做路由信号，而不是默认返还很长的原文段落。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 132.361,
      "spokenStart": 132.515,
      "spokenEnd": 138.265,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "实际操作时，先写清当前目标、对象、风险和下一步需要什么支持。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.736,
      "audioStart": 138.268,
      "spokenStart": 138.425,
      "spokenEnd": 143.38,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "再用这些线索挑选少量事实和技能，不要因为共享一个宽泛关键词就拿回全部记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 143.391,
      "spokenStart": 143.54,
      "spokenEnd": 149.207,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "选中的记忆进入基础智能体前，还要压缩成行动指引：已知什么、什么重要、还要核对什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.152,
      "audioStart": 149.212,
      "spokenStart": 149.367,
      "spokenEnd": 155.716,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这样即使模型切换、窗口变短，下一步也能从同一份明确的决策依据继续。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.76,
      "audioStart": 155.654,
      "spokenStart": 155.816,
      "spokenEnd": 160.788,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果答案依赖实时变化的信息，检索旧记忆仍然不够，必须补充当前来源的证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.832,
      "audioStart": 160.784,
      "spokenStart": 160.948,
      "spokenEnd": 165.968,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 165.974,
      "spokenStart": 166.128,
      "spokenEnd": 166.804,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，从当前决策路由，不从模糊话题路由。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.672,
      "audioStart": 166.743,
      "spokenStart": 166.904,
      "spokenEnd": 169.769,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，交给智能体的是行动指引，不是整段聊天记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 169.767,
      "spokenStart": 169.929,
      "spokenEnd": 173.509,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，变化中的事实必须补充新证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 173.509,
      "spokenStart": 173.669,
      "spokenEnd": 176.305,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 5 章：记忆周期。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.04,
      "audioStart": 176.325,
      "spokenStart": 176.485,
      "spokenEnd": 177.727,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "决定每条内容是保留、压缩，还是退出工作记忆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 177.67,
      "spokenStart": 177.827,
      "spokenEnd": 180.974,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当一条内容已核实、很可能影响以后决策，并且有清晰检索线索时，应该保留。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6,
      "audioStart": 180.977,
      "spokenStart": 181.134,
      "spokenEnd": 186.349,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当一次事件很长，但经验能变成事实、规则、检查清单或交接笔记时，应该提炼。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.792,
      "audioStart": 186.349,
      "spokenStart": 186.509,
      "spokenEnd": 192.501,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当内容过期、重复、置信度低，或只适合审计而不适合行动时，应退出主动检索。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.696,
      "audioStart": 192.5,
      "spokenStart": 192.661,
      "spokenEnd": 198.556,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "退出工作记忆不等于删除证据；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 198.561,
      "spokenStart": 198.716,
      "spokenEnd": 200.649,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "治理和排障需要时，原始轨迹仍应可查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 200.586,
      "spokenStart": 200.749,
      "spokenEnd": 203.5,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u03",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "真正要避免的是旧材料在没有任务价值时不断被召回，并让新证据失去应有的位置。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.312,
      "audioStart": 203.435,
      "spokenStart": 203.6,
      "spokenEnd": 209.12,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "还要写复查日期，因为曾经正确的政策、工具结果或偏好会随环境变化变得误导人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 209.126,
      "spokenStart": 209.28,
      "spokenEnd": 215.027,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 215.033,
      "spokenStart": 215.187,
      "spokenEnd": 215.858,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，保留能持续影响决策的可靠事实。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 215.803,
      "spokenStart": 215.958,
      "spokenEnd": 218.668,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，把长经验提炼成规则或技能。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 218.67,
      "spokenStart": 218.828,
      "spokenEnd": 221.321,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，让过期和重复内容退出主动检索，但保留审计轨迹。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.92,
      "audioStart": 221.32,
      "spokenStart": 221.481,
      "spokenEnd": 225.61,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 6 章：记忆表。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 1.896,
      "audioStart": 225.634,
      "spokenStart": 225.79,
      "spokenEnd": 226.888,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "下一次长任务前，用保留、提炼、遗忘表做一次筛选。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 226.829,
      "spokenStart": 226.988,
      "spokenEnd": 230.76,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "每条候选记忆写六个字段：记忆项、下一任务价值、状态、紧凑形式、检索线索和复查日期。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.632,
      "audioStart": 230.758,
      "spokenStart": 230.92,
      "spokenEnd": 237.748,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果部署约束改变了权限，就保留这条已核实约束，并写清它影响哪个系统和动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.312,
      "audioStart": 237.74,
      "spokenStart": 237.908,
      "spokenEnd": 243.427,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果一次排障发现了可重复的修复方式，就提炼成技能：触发条件、步骤、证据和停止条件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.296,
      "audioStart": 243.423,
      "spokenStart": 243.587,
      "spokenEnd": 250.073,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果五份记录都讲了同一个发现，留下一个可追溯来源，让重复记录退出主动检索。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.528,
      "audioStart": 250.063,
      "spokenStart": 250.233,
      "spokenEnd": 255.948,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "若后来发现结论只适用于某个工具版本，就在同一行补上边界和复查日期，而不是再堆一份相似摘要。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.584,
      "audioStart": 255.882,
      "spokenStart": 256.048,
      "spokenEnd": 262.821,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果你说不出它能改善哪个下一步决策，它大概率不该永久占据智能体的工作记忆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.024,
      "audioStart": 262.81,
      "spokenStart": 262.981,
      "spokenEnd": 268.184,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.464,
      "audioStart": 268.19,
      "spokenStart": 268.344,
      "spokenEnd": 269.015,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，保存前先写清它的决策价值。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.072,
      "audioStart": 268.959,
      "spokenStart": 269.115,
      "spokenEnd": 271.402,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，有意识地选择保留、提炼或遗忘。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.456,
      "audioStart": 271.399,
      "spokenStart": 271.562,
      "spokenEnd": 274.21,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，补上检索线索和复查日期，让记忆持续有用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.296,
      "audioStart": 274.21,
      "spokenStart": 274.37,
      "spokenEnd": 277.867,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "AI 智能体不会因为把每条旧消息都带进每个新任务，就自动变得更聪明。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.376,
      "audioStart": 277.88,
      "spokenStart": 278.047,
      "spokenEnd": 282.612,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原始历史适合追溯；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.016,
      "audioStart": 282.605,
      "spokenStart": 282.772,
      "spokenEnd": 283.98,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "对行动来说，能够复用的事实和技能往往才是更好的输入。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.608,
      "audioStart": 283.918,
      "spokenStart": 284.08,
      "spokenEnd": 287.882,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "从当前决策开始路由记忆，再把结果压缩到不读完整过去也能看清重点的程度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.832,
      "audioStart": 287.889,
      "spokenStart": 288.042,
      "spokenEnd": 293.084,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "用保留、提炼、遗忘表把保存、检索和退出变成明确选择，而不是偶然发生。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.384,
      "audioStart": 293.075,
      "spokenStart": 293.244,
      "spokenEnd": 298.815,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原文的基准结果值得参考，但它更适合推动你检验自己的记忆设计，不是所有智能体都一定提升的保证。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.344,
      "audioStart": 298.81,
      "spokenStart": 298.975,
      "spokenEnd": 305.517,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "关注 Tiny Agent，成为更擅长使用 AI 的人！",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 305.509,
      "spokenStart": 305.677,
      "spokenEnd": 308.178,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    }
